ion Suites</a></div>\n                <div class=\"insight-author\">prime-radiant-inc | Platform</div>\n                <div class=\"item-description\">Tool for running small evaluation suites across different model configurations and grading results.</div>\n                <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                    <span class=\"topic-tag\">developer tools</span>\n                    <span class=\"topic-tag\">evaluation</span>\n                    <span class=\"topic-tag\">LLM testing</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"insight-item\">\n                <div class=\"insight-title\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28617\">AISPA: System Prompt Auditing for LLMs</a></div>\n                <div class=\"insight-author\">Xiangning Lin et al. | Paper</div>\n                <div class=\"item-description\">User-centric framework for auditing LLM system prompts with better oversight and validation.</div>\n                <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                    <span class=\"topic-tag\">LLM</span>\n                    <span class=\"topic-tag\">auditing</span>\n                    <span class=\"topic-tag\">safety</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"insight-item\">\n                <div class=\"insight-title\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28609\">OSReward: Cross-Platform Computer-Use Evaluation</a></div>\n                <div class=\"insight-author\">Qiushi Sun et al. | Paper</div>\n                <div class=\"item-description\">Standardized evaluation framework for reward models across computer-use platforms.</div>\n                <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                    <span class=\"topic-tag\">computer-use</span>\n                    <span class=\"topic-tag\">evaluation</span>\n                    <span class=\"topic-tag\">reward models</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"insight-item\">\n             