2>Whitelist Updates (0)</h2>\n   433→            <div class=\"empty-state\">\n   434→                No updates found for tracked products in this research cycle.\n   435→            </div>\n   436→        </section>\n   437→\n   438→        <section class=\"technical-insights\">\n   439→            <h2>Technical Insights (24)</h2>\n   440→\n   441→            <div class=\"insight-item\">\n   442→                <div class=\"insight-title\"><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731\">DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731: Enhanced Agentic Capabilities</a></div>\n   443→                <div class=\"insight-author\">DeepSeek AI | Platform</div>\n   444→                <div class=\"item-description\">Enhanced agentic capabilities at lower cost ($0.14/M input, $0.27/M output) with strong benchmark performance.</div>\n   445→                <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n   446→                    <span class=\"topic-tag\">LLM</span>\n   447→                    <span class=\"topic-tag\">AI coding</span>\n   448→                    <span class=\"topic-tag\">benchmarks</span>\n   449→                </div>\n   450→            </div>\n   451→\n   452→            <div class=\"insight-item\">\n   453→                <div class=\"insight-title\"><a href=\"https://github.com/prime-radiant-inc/smevals\">smevals: Small Evaluation Suites</a></div>\n   454→                <div class=\"insight-author\">prime-radiant-inc | Platform</div>\n   455→                <div class=\"item-description\">Tool for running small evaluation suites across different model configurations and grading results.</div>\n   456→                <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n   457→                    <span class=\"topic-tag\">developer tools</span>\n   458→                    <span class=\"topic-tag\">evaluation</span>\n   459→                    <span class=\"topic-tag\">LLM testing</span>\n   460→                </div>\n   461→            </div>\n   462→\n   463→            <div class=\"insig