opics\">\n   490→                    <span class=\"topic-tag\">computer-use</span>\n   491→                    <span class=\"topic-tag\">inference</span>\n   492→                    <span class=\"topic-tag\">optimization</span>\n   493→                </div>\n   494→            </div>\n   495→\n   496→            <div class=\"insight-item\">\n   497→                <div class=\"insight-title\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28367\">How Benchmarks Mis-Score Computer-Use Agents</a></div>\n   498→                <div class=\"insight-author\">Zihan Dong et al. | Paper</div>\n   499→                <div class=\"item-description\">Examines fundamental issues with how current benchmarks score AI agents.</div>\n   500→                <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n   501→                    <span class=\"topic-tag\">benchmarks</span>\n   502→                    <span class=\"topic-tag\">computer-use</span>\n   503→                    <span class=\"topic-tag\">evaluation</span>\n   504→                </div>\n   505→            </div>\n   506→\n   507→            <div class=\"insight-item\">\n   508→                <div class=\"insight-title\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28418\">WIDE: Token-level Dynamic Width Pruning</a></div>\n   509→                <div class=\"insight-author\">Haozhe Hu et al. | Paper</div>\n   510→                <div class=\"item-description\">Optimizes adaptive LLM inference through dynamic pruning techniques.</div>\n   511→                <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n   512→                    <span class=\"topic-tag\">LLM</span>\n   513→                    <span class=\"topic-tag\">optimization</span>\n   514→                    <span class=\"topic-tag\">pruning</span>\n   515→                </div>\n   516→            </div>\n   517→\n   518→            <div class=\"insight-item\">\n   519→                <div class=\"insight-title\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28069\">SemPIC: Semantic Position-Independent KV Caches</a><